# AgentSec Testing

No important feature is complete until tested.

Use:

tests/unit/
tests/integration/
tests/security/
tests/telemetry/
tests/workshops/
tests/detections/
tests/splunk/

Test:

NORMAL INPUT

MALICIOUS INPUT

MALFORMED INPUT

BOUNDARY CONDITION

DEPENDENCY FAILURE

SECURITY BYPASS ATTEMPT

Test deterministic security logic separately from nondeterministic LLM behavior.

Security assertions should focus on:

authorization
control decision
tool invocation
state transition
identity
trust level
telemetry
correlation
evidence

When fixing bugs:

1. reproduce bug
2. create failing regression test
3. fix code
4. run regression test
5. run related test suite

Never claim passing tests unless actually executed.
